        "# Finder\n",
        "\n",
        "A finder is an object in Python's import system that locates a module and returns a module spec describing how it should be loaded.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-finder)"
      ]
